<title>USA: Ecology and Environment gets two contracts.</title>
<headline>Ecology and Environment gets two contracts.</headline>
<dateline>BUFFALO, N.Y. 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ecology and Environment Inc said Wednesday it was awarded two contracts by the Florida Department of Environmental Protection for site investigation and hazard scoring at Superfund sites throughout Florida, and another for waste site and drycleaning solvent cleanup services.</p>
<p>The company said in a release that the contract for site investigation has a duration of five years with a total value of $5 million and the other is for four years with a total value of $8 million.</p>
</text>
